OL,3,GNEWSADrivers warned over car park
OL,4,Ademolition disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers in Nottingham have been warned
OL,7,Fabout "severe congestion" due to the
OL,8,Fplanned demolition of a car park in the
OL,9,Fcity centre.
OL,11,FThe NCP car park, in Maid Marian Way,
OL,12,Fwill soon be torn down and form part of
OL,13,Fthe wider redevelopment of the Broad
OL,14,FMarsh area.
OL,16,FOn Monday, diversions in place ahead of
OL,17,Fthe demolition led to delays for bus
OL,18,Fand tram services in the city.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
